├── Restore capability
├── Actual restore test
└── Uncovered items

Final summary-তে অবশ্যই দেখাবে:

AZURE:
Persistent disks: X
Native backup: VERIFIED / NOT VERIFIED
Application backup: VERIFIED / NOT VERIFIED
Uncovered persistent items: X

GCP:
Persistent disks: X
Native backup: VERIFIED / NOT VERIFIED
Application backup: VERIFIED / NOT VERIFIED
Uncovered persistent items: X

GCS:
Database/application objects: X
CREATE: PASS/FAIL
DELETE: DENIED/PASS
OVERWRITE: DENIED/PASS
READ: DENIED/PASS

FINAL:
Uncovered persistent data = 0 / NOT 0
Restore capability = VERIFIED / NOT VERIFIED
Actual restore test = PASS / NOT TESTED

FINAL HARD STOP

এই চারটি condition পূরণ না হওয়া পর্যন্ত কোনোভাবেই VM delete/format/rebuild-এর recommendation দেবে না:

1. GCP Machine Image = READY + disk inventory matched
2. Azure Restore Point = successfully created + both managed disks verified
3. GCS application/database backups = hash/integrity verified
4. Uncovered persistent data = 0

